{"about_the_game":"Defend and rebuild Washington, D.C. after a devastating pandemic in this tactical open world third-person shooter:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL COMBAT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/148a120980b159cd8923fef7fccfb4bf.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/148a120980b159cd8923fef7fccfb4bf.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/148a120980b159cd8923fef7fccfb4bf.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Engage enemies in intense, cover-based firefights where tactical positioning and utility usage make the difference between life and death.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD THE ULTIMATE AGENT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/fdaf7df9fe1484ea1649a2a21545c853.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/fdaf7df9fe1484ea1649a2a21545c853.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/fdaf7df9fe1484ea1649a2a21545c853.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Loot and craft cutting-edge gear and learn powerful skills to customize the way you fight. Take things further with Specializations, with roles like the long-range marksman, the demolition expert, the survivalist leader, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAMWORK SAVES LIVES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/75289faeadbb3622410780aba911ad57.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/75289faeadbb3622410780aba911ad57.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/75289faeadbb3622410780aba911ad57.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Team up with up to three other agents for tactical co-op missions where synergy matters. Combine Specializations, share resources, and take on dynamic challenges that scale with your squad.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE EVER-EVOLVING WASHINGTON, D.C.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/3d622aa311d0252311dda92da1e764ed.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/3d622aa311d0252311dda92da1e764ed.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/3d622aa311d0252311dda92da1e764ed.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>From tense firefights in changing weather to the constant push and pull of factions warring over map control, the city reacts, adapts, and challenges you to survive with every move you make.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISCERAL ENDGAME</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/5b71e6eade9033d27823456aff15e57a.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/5b71e6eade9033d27823456aff15e57a.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/5b71e6eade9033d27823456aff15e57a.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Reaching max level is just the start. Dive into high-stakes endgame missions, intense PvP battles, and dynamic world events that push your skills and teamwork to the limit. Every season brings fresh rewards and fierce challenges.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Checking In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/248f54f45b22a10464ff10efa823ad9dfbe6ba87.jpg"},{"name":"Opening the Vault","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/8c560e09170e231916f9edfbfbf7afa9976e8531.jpg"},{"name":"Bunker Buster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/26afdeee23835c8f6a5813397d28942c67e3c8a7.jpg"},{"name":"Sick Note","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/0f9d9e5677940f018d71888581bd1b0c5c165103.jpg"},{"name":"Jailbreak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/0c03f493ecf3f177a61fab3cf6372de6155987a9.jpg"},{"name":"Global Communications","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/48ff35b5e4d7875c7bce92fcbee32ff69c43ca47.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the Word Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/7244235d990907b9e3452cbde2d5213ff6869123.jpg"},{"name":"Season Ticket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/b98ef6fae6664365e84c68c03e880eef5baa8424.jpg"},{"name":"Strategic Extraction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/bdee2d910f9f5c9db7e6eff8f48225492f32f6ea.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Wilderness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2221490/8c1e8e2f85e05bc517ba660f277a5668aec854b4.jpg"}],"total":67},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2221490?t=1772217895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772217895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/b97763366f3f1bfe1a5bab3d12db65d7d981d40a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772217895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/b97763366f3f1bfe1a5bab3d12db65d7d981d40a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772217895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This is a tactical third-person shooter in which players assume the role of an elite government agent battling hostile factions in a fictionalized Washington D.C. Players use machine guns, sniper rifles, and explosives to kill waves of enemy soldiers/thugs in frenetic combat."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Comparative Grid</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/0366b19072ccf437e6f76552df1f1deb.avif?t=1772217895\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><br><h1>Ultimate Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/edf2b1dff42ec73399f593eaf0d75151.avif?t=1772217895\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><br>TOM CLANCY\u2019S THE DIVISION 2 ULTIMATE EDITION INCLUDES:<br><br>\u00b7 The base game;<br>\u00b7 The Warlords of New York expansion;<br>\u00b7 The Battle for Brooklyn DLC;<br>\u00b7 1,000 Bonus Premium Credits;<br>\u00b7 A level 40 boost, allowing you to jump into the Battle for Brooklyn campaign;<br>\u00b7 Stash space increase;<br>\u00b7 All six endgame Specializations instantly unlocked;<br>\u00b7 Eight exclusive missions;<br>\u00b7 The Battleworn Secret Service Pack;<br>\u00b7 The First Responder Pack;<br>\u00b7 The Elite Agent Pack;<br>\u00b7 One exclusive emote and outfit.</p><br><h1>Gold Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/43b4d4a752cd56c7b79e39b08232f31a.avif?t=1772217895\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><br>TOM CLANCY\u2019S THE DIVISION 2 GOLD EDITION INCLUDES:<br><br>\u00b7 The base game;<br>\u00b7 The Warlords of New York expansion;<br>\u00b7 The Battle for Brooklyn DLC;<br>\u00b7 A level 40 boost, allowing you to jump into the Battle for Brooklyn campaign;<br>\u00b7 Stash space increase.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Defend and rebuild Washington, D.C. after a devastating pandemic in this tactical open world third-person shooter:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL COMBAT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/148a120980b159cd8923fef7fccfb4bf.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/148a120980b159cd8923fef7fccfb4bf.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/148a120980b159cd8923fef7fccfb4bf.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Engage enemies in intense, cover-based firefights where tactical positioning and utility usage make the difference between life and death.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD THE ULTIMATE AGENT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/fdaf7df9fe1484ea1649a2a21545c853.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/fdaf7df9fe1484ea1649a2a21545c853.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/fdaf7df9fe1484ea1649a2a21545c853.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Loot and craft cutting-edge gear and learn powerful skills to customize the way you fight. Take things further with Specializations, with roles like the long-range marksman, the demolition expert, the survivalist leader, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAMWORK SAVES LIVES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/75289faeadbb3622410780aba911ad57.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/75289faeadbb3622410780aba911ad57.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/75289faeadbb3622410780aba911ad57.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Team up with up to three other agents for tactical co-op missions where synergy matters. Combine Specializations, share resources, and take on dynamic challenges that scale with your squad.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE EVER-EVOLVING WASHINGTON, D.C.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/3d622aa311d0252311dda92da1e764ed.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/3d622aa311d0252311dda92da1e764ed.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/3d622aa311d0252311dda92da1e764ed.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>From tense firefights in changing weather to the constant push and pull of factions warring over map control, the city reacts, adapts, and challenges you to survive with every move you make.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISCERAL ENDGAME</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/5b71e6eade9033d27823456aff15e57a.poster.avif?t=1772217895\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/5b71e6eade9033d27823456aff15e57a.webm?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/5b71e6eade9033d27823456aff15e57a.mp4?t=1772217895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Reaching max level is just the start. Dive into high-stakes endgame missions, intense PvP battles, and dynamic world events that push your skills and teamwork to the limit. Every season brings fresh rewards and fierce challenges.","developers":["Ubisoft"],"dlc":[4064190,3572160,4064210,3572140,3268800,2222570],"drm_notice":"VM Protect","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/header.jpg?t=1772217895","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2019 Ubisoft Entertainment.